WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:57.580
<i>Indeed, tomorrow
is a day to commemorate.</i>

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.990
I refuse to let them
enter the village!

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:10.090
Straight north!
Straight north!

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:13.430
They're in big trouble
if they touch my treasure!

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:17.760
Dammit! What do I do?!
I can't climb up!

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.100
Outta the damn way!

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:30.010
I can't let you
get past this slope...

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:35.180
Because I only lied
like I always do...

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:38.250
So the village is going to
have just another ordinary day!

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:41.350
So I absolutely
won't let you go!

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.790
They're late...

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:50.800
They all know full
well what happens...

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:55.140
...to those who
upset my plans...

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.130
I'll slaughter them all!

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:24.000
"The Terrifying Duo!
Meowban Brothers vs. Zoro"

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.210
About time...

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:47.750
Y-you guys are that strong?!

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.030
Yeah!

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:54.700
What took you guys so long?!

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.700
<i>You're the one who
got me stuck back there!</i>

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.700
That was an accident!
It couldn't be helped!

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.640
It's better for one person
to be saved...

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.840
...than for two to stay
down there...

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.970
<i>Then you should've stayed!</i>

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:12.750
Seriously! How am I supposed to
know which way north is and isn't?!

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:17.650
<i>What?! You're the one who ran off
first, all full of confidence!</i>

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.420
That was just because.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.120
Night is long gone now...

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:26.460
He - Captain Kuro -
has a short temper...

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:33.860
Hey, men! Don't tell me those
two brats did you all in?!

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:43.680
Listen! We don't have time
to be dilly-dallying here!

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:47.080
If our enemy is strong,
we just need to be stronger!

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.850
Now watch this ring closely!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:53.220
On "one, two, Jango",
you guys'll grow strong.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.920
Your wounds will
be completely healed,

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.630
and you will grow
stronger and stronger!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.460
What're they doing?

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.960
It's hypnosis!

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.470
He's trying to convince
them to be stronger!

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:05.800
How ridiculous!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.660
Stronger... Stronger!

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:17.240
One! Two!

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:18.580
Jango!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:24.320
No way!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:40.100
H-he gouged out the cliff!

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:42.770
What power!

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:45.510
They really did
get hypnotized!

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.770
With that many people
that strong...

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:54.680
Go! Crush anyone
who gets in the way!

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:08.600
You guys get back!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.930
<i>We'll handle this!</i>

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.830
Hey, Luffy!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.140
Luffy?!

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.580
You got hypnotized too?!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:38.250
W-what a simple-minded person!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.330
Gum-Gum...

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:48.670
...Gatling!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.080
Damn you, Captain Kuro...

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:03.150
You were completely wrong
to think he'd have no effect!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.810
These guys are
no ordinary brats!

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:27.030
Where is he going?!

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:38.080
--Wha-?
--What's he planning to do?!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.490
Go! Luffy!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.370
He's gonna destroy the ship!

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.110
No, he's not!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:09.280
<i>He's gonna crush us with that!</i>

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.790
Please do something, Captain!

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:16.780
Crap! Crap! This was
no time to be gawking!

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.690
On "one, two, Jango",
you'll get sleepy!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.400
One!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.740
Two!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.230
Jango!

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:03.700
Eh?! Klahadore the butler
went to the shore?!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:06.810
Yeah! And he had a scary
look on his face!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.480
<i>Is Kaya-san okay?!</i>

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:13.110
Alright! Let's move out,
Usopp Pirates!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:14.950
Hey! Quit sleeping!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.120
But I should still
be in bed...

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.620
This is no time
to be sleeping!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.930
We could be in trouble!

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.260
Eh?

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:32.130
I think pirates really
are going to attack us.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:36.240
<i>Our captain said he was lying,
but I think that was a lie!</i>

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.440
I think so, too!

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:42.340
Me too! Something just wasn't
right about our captain yesterday!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.650
You don't think...

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:03.860
But our captain used
to go through here!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.330
No good!
It's closed up!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.830
Let's look
for another one!

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:27.690
You! How dare you make
a fool of me,

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:31.630
insulting me for having
the blood of a pirate!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:33.790
<i>Stop, Usopp-san!</i>

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.210
Klahadore...

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:06.990
Are you there, Klahadore?

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.330
Klahadore?

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.670
M- Merry!

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:19.770
Merry!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:22.080
What's wrong?!
What happened?!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.780
Open your eyes, Merry!

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:28.120
--Please don't die!
--M- Miss...

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.190
Thank goodness,
you're all right...

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:32.520
Merry!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:39.290
Merry?
W-who did this?!

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:43.630
Klahadore!
He... attacked me!

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:50.900
He... he was
a pirate all along!

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:53.670
W-what are you talking about?

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:59.780
He got close to you
so he could get your fortune...

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:02.350
No... That's absurd!

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:04.680
It's the truth!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:19.320
<i>Then, what Usopp-san
said yesterday was...</i>

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.070
Yes. Now that
I think about it,

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:29.440
he tried his hardest to help
us when he learned the truth!

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:35.640
Yet, not a single one of us
even tried to hear him out!

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.980
You gotta run, Kaya!
They're gonna kill you!

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.610
You gotta escape for now!

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:51.700
<i>We protected a real villain
and drove off that brave lad...</i>

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:57.370
...who ran about with
desperate resolve,

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:00.030
all for the villagers' sake!

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:05.410
S-someone help!
Merry is-!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:08.140
It's no use, Miss!

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:16.260
The staff has been on
leave since yesterday.

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:19.130
What?! Then I'll...

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.260
You mustn't get flustered!

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:24.730
The incident hasn't
happened yet!

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:29.070
You must think calmly about
what you need to do now!

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:35.640
If Klahadore's goal
is your fortune and mansion,

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:39.650
then just let him have it all!

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:42.980
They're not worth protecting
with your life!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:47.520
You're right.

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:49.060
Cruel as it may be,

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:53.190
you are the only one who
can stop Klahadore now.

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:56.800
Can you do it?

00:13:56.800 --> 00:14:00.360
This isn't your
responsibility, but...

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:09.210
Even I know this isn't a
situation I can run from...

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:11.370
I understand that fully!

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:16.240
I'll talk things
over with Klahadore!

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:39.340
What're you doing?!

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:41.010
Hold on tight!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:43.840
But these bars
are slippery!

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.840
Climb over anyways!

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:50.420
<i>Aren't you worried
about Kaya-san?!</i>

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.090
Oh no!
Someone's coming out!

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.420
Hide!

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.290
<i>--It's Kaya-san!
--She's alright!</i>

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:14.640
It looks like something
has her worried!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.810
<i>Kaya-san, walking outside
all by herself...</i>

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:21.810
<i>Something's up!
Something's gotta be up!</i>

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:40.230
Looks like they're
just about wiped out!

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:41.640
I guess so.

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:46.210
Hey! Never mind that,
Luffy's trapped under there!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.010
He won't die.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:51.000
Worry about your
own injuries or somethin'.

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:56.450
Damn that brat!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.750
<i>Now the plan's
really screwed up!</i>

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:01.350
If Captain Kuro
caught sight of this,

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.690
he'd slaughter all
of us, too!

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:08.730
Hey, Butchie! Come look!
This is bad stuff!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.330
What the hell?!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.700
We still have a trump card!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.690
Come forth, Meowban Brothers!

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:24.470
You called, Captain Jango?

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.710
You called?

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:28.980
Siam...

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.120
...and Butchie!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:33.810
Together,
we are the Meowban Brothers!

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:43.200
<i>Butchie! Siam! We absolutely
must get past this hill,</i>

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.630
but as you can see,
an obstacle is in the way!

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.120
Get rid of it.

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:52.810
W-we can't possibly
do that!

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.240
Right, Butchie?!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.210
Yeah, he looks strong!

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:58.780
Huh?

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:02.020
And besides, we're just
supposed to guard the ship!

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:05.920
Yeah! This isn't really
our place to fight...

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:11.290
<i>W-what?
They're not their trump card?!</i>

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:13.490
Siam! Get going already!

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.360
Eh?! M-me?!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:16.400
Hurry!

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:19.200
O-okay, okay! I'll go!

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.690
He's in tears!
What's he's trying to do?!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:26.070
<i>Why's he making him fight?</i>

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:28.640
Hey, you! Get ready!

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:31.640
I'm gonna scratch you good
with these claws!

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:36.320
What am I supposed to do?!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.880
Hey, you!
Stop or I'll kill you!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.650
--If you can!
--What?!

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:47.990
What the hell?!

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:52.070
You! You just underestimated me,
didn't you?!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:56.670
I'm impressed you could block that,
after my innocent cat act!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.270
You seem to have a little skill,

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:03.370
but I wouldn't underestimate
Siam of the Meowban Brothers!

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:12.350
Missing something?
Don't look at me, though...

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:15.260
--There it is...
--"Cat Burglar"...

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.320
Give those swords back!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:21.690
Give them back?
But you already have a sword.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.030
These are just in the way.

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:37.280
Alright! Now I'm much lighter!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.810
You're supposed to take good
care of other people's things!

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:46.320
Bastard!

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.560
What?!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.730
What did you cut?!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.720
I can bend like a cat!

00:18:57.430 --> 00:18:59.870
You're up, Butchie!
Get 'im!

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:02.370
Right, Siam!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.700
Cat...

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:08.930
...Astrophe!

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:14.380
Damn! He got away!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.950
Hey! Hold him down, Siam!

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:18.280
My bad!

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:22.120
The bastard's way
stronger than I thought!

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:23.760
<i>What the hell?!</i>

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:29.460
<i>One hit from that'd turn
every bone in my body to powder!</i>

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:32.970
--He's not getting away this time!
--'As right!

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:36.060
I'm not that great
at the One-Sword Style, but...

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.770
Let's go, Butchie!

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:42.980
Okay! Let's do it, Siam!

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:45.840
--Pussy Willow March!
--Pussy Willow March!

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:58.820
Oh no!
They got Zoro on the defensive!

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:03.330
What're you doing?!

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.500
He's not gonna get anywhere
just blocking...

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:07.230
...those two guys' attacks!

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:08.740
I'm gonna help him out!

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.400
Take this!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.740
Lead Star!

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.280
Gotcha!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.680
<i>Why're you attacking
a guy on our side?!</i>

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:30.190
No, it's not like that!

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:33.860
It seemed like he let
it hit him on purpose...

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:36.020
Eh?! On purpose?!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.530
Usopp, you dumbass!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:41.020
<i>Do you want to die?!</i>

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.370
You don't suppose...

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:50.040
<i>...we're the ones who
just got saved?</i>

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:53.880
Had you hit them
with that slingshot,

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:57.880
those two probably would've
come after us instead!

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:59.690
He...

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:02.020
But this is no time for that!

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:09.590
<i>Damn it!
If I just had another sword!</i>

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.940
I'm gonna get his swords!

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:18.100
If I give 'em back to Zoro,
he'll win for sure!

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:20.340
In that case, I'll do it!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:23.830
Don't push yourself!
You can barely even stand!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.840
Nami!

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:47.970
Nami!

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:50.300
What do you need swords for?

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:09.380
No! Uhh! I- I can explain!

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:17.560
Night is long gone now,

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:22.540
so it seemed odd that the plan
wasn't making any progress...

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:24.770
C- Captain Kuro!

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:26.300
W-we're dead!

00:22:32.780 --> 00:22:34.770
This can't get any worse!

00:22:48.230 --> 00:22:52.220
What is all this?!

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
